## Model card

- **Name:** Omen Alpha
- **Short description:** Anonymous stealth reasoning model served on OpenCode Go/TokenRa routes, marketed for coding/agentic use with zero-day retention and undisclosed vendor/parameters.
- **Provider / access:** Anonymous vendor via OpenCode Go / TokenRa API route (`omen-alpha`). Local metadata lists pricing $0.20/$0.66 per 1M (promo $0.08/$0.26) and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not publicly disclosed. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated.
- **IDs:** `omen-alpha`.
- **Context window:** ~500,000 tokens (third-party listing per metadata); 128,000 max output.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (metadata/landing page claims).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.20/$0.66 per 1M in/out, $0.04 cached; TokenRa promo $0.08/$0.26 per 1M (metadata/landing page).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary/undisclosed. Vendor and parameter count not publicly disclosed.

